#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/perturb-card.md:3
#: b8b7df2d9421453f922c36b81757b16c
msgid "原子扰动（Atomic Perturb）"
msgstr "Atomic Perturb"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/perturb-card.md:5
#: a22863f2fa534c0d8654a595c428b5d3
msgid "**分类：** 扰动"
msgstr "**Category:** Perturbations"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/perturb-card.md:7
#: f1346050669a4d9e9d72431984f54359
msgid "功能说明"
msgstr "Purpose"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/perturb-card.md:9
#: 4552e10f777648e88c8fdac37867b7c2
msgid "为每个输入结构生成若干随机位移副本，用于补充平衡位置附近的力和局部曲率信息。它只改变原子笛卡尔坐标，不改变晶胞、周期边界或元素。"
msgstr ""
"Generate several randomly displaced copies of each input structure to add"
" force and local-curvature information around equilibrium positions. Only"
" Cartesian atomic coordinates are changed; the cell, periodic boundaries,"
" and elements remain unchanged."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/perturb-card.md:11
#: dd2c47411c064578a5e48148008d7b58
#
msgid "随机位移可能缩短原子间距，运行后建议检查最短距离；需要批量把关时，可在后面连接“几何健全性过滤”。"
msgstr "Random displacements can shorten interatomic distances. Check the minimum distance after running, or connect `Geometry Sanity Filter` downstream for batch validation."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/perturb-card.md:13
#: 3920c0f9d75e4bb696357ef7e2f9ccbb
msgid "原理与公式"
msgstr "Principles and Equations"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/perturb-card.md:15
#: 6d6cb40bbe8d4d6c83b8dc1f2ca3ae58
msgid "对原子 $i$，位移从半径为 $d_i$ 的三维球内均匀采样："
msgstr ""
"For atom $i$, the displacement is sampled uniformly from a three-"
"dimensional ball of radius $d_i$:"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/perturb-card.md:17
#: 5df16bc16ee4408b8ef63c0cf68596e4
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"\n"
"\\Delta\\mathbf r_i=\\rho_i\\hat{\\mathbf u}_i,\n"
"\\qquad\n"
"0\\leq \\rho_i\\leq d_i,\n"
"\\qquad\n"
"\\mathbf r_i'=\\mathbf r_i+\\Delta\\mathbf r_i.\n"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/perturb-card.md:25
#: 443e717e2d6d4c84af129a90734d4acc
msgid "因此约束的是位移向量长度 $\\|\\Delta\\mathbf r_i\\|\\leq d_i$，不是 x、y、z 三个分量分别小于 $d_i$。"
msgstr ""
"The constraint therefore applies to the displacement-vector length, "
"$\\|\\Delta\\mathbf r_i\\|\\leq d_i$, rather than requiring each x, y, "
"and z component separately to be smaller than $d_i$."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/perturb-card.md:27
#: 2956ae53870d43d8b94876b5be873366
msgid "未设置逐元素上限时，所有原子使用全局 $d_i=d$。"
msgstr "Without per-element limits, every atom uses the global value $d_i=d$."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/perturb-card.md:28
#: 87521f941be84221acaa08bbd48feece
msgid "设置逐元素上限后，列出的元素使用自己的 $d_i$，其他元素仍使用全局值。"
msgstr ""
"With per-element limits enabled, listed elements use their own $d_i$ "
"values and all other elements continue to use the global value."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/perturb-card.md:29
#: 96c7fd971d914343a232145bf7d57241
msgid "开启“有机分子刚体平移”后，自动识别的有机连通簇共用一个平移向量，分子内部距离不变。若一个分子含多种元素，则采用其中最严格的位移上限。"
msgstr ""
"With `Rigid translation of organic molecules` enabled, each automatically"
" detected organic connected component shares one translation vector, so "
"intramolecular distances remain unchanged. If a molecule contains "
"multiple elements, the strictest displacement limit among them is used."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/perturb-card.md:30
#: dc153173d7f04ca3995f83d086304791
msgid "扰动后的坐标按原结构 PBC 回到晶胞内；晶胞矩阵和 PBC 标志保持不变。"
msgstr ""
"Perturbed coordinates are wrapped into the cell according to the original"
" PBC. The cell matrix and PBC flags remain unchanged."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/perturb-card.md:32
#: 1c1a3dc91ef54721a27d597015366cb0
msgid "两种采样引擎"
msgstr "Two Sampling Engines"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/perturb-card.md
#: 7699f8d8c4e940baad70daec70e4a670
msgid "引擎"
msgstr "Engine"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/perturb-card.md
#: 4551f6155a8540b5b55992e2a6b10549
msgid "适用场景"
msgstr "Use Case"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/perturb-card.md
#: 19d3c72325124de482ca0a1e8ed1383f
msgid "限制"
msgstr "Limit"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/perturb-card.md
#: 700926bf57e3402aae58354c921873e7
msgid "Uniform"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/perturb-card.md
#: ed5a0ec4b3e94bfa8dc81adfe2beb611
msgid "通用默认；任意正输出数"
msgstr "General default; any positive output count"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/perturb-card.md
#: 0c4b3f6b097f4f55b624bdb4c92e4875
msgid "伪随机采样"
msgstr "Pseudorandom sampling"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/perturb-card.md
#: 29ed4abad29349fa9f983a00ff05c5a2
msgid "Sobol"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/perturb-card.md
#: 484f1f84bf84408583d5038dc5dbb7e4
msgid "少量样本时改善空间覆盖"
msgstr "Improved space coverage for small sample sets"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/perturb-card.md
#: cbac09e915694508b25397c3199b14c3
msgid "最多 7,067 个原子；输出数取 4、8、16…时覆盖性质最好"
msgstr "At most 7,067 atoms; coverage is best with 4, 8, 16, … outputs"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/perturb-card.md:39
#: 7e18a05e0e1f471383284acd9df2f73f
msgid "选择 Sobol 但输出数不是 2 的幂不会改变请求数量，界面只给出提示。"
msgstr ""
"Selecting Sobol with an output count that is not a power of two does not "
"change the requested count; the interface only displays an advisory "
"message."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/perturb-card.md:41
#: 0783269482554d5e952d2abe97327118
msgid "操作示例"
msgstr "Example"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/perturb-card.md:43
#: 3a1058ec5c11413da768e4c3807124ef
msgid "为两帧 Si 结构补充近平衡样本"
msgstr "Add Near-Equilibrium Samples for Two Si Frames"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/perturb-card.md:45
#: 6d994ae5d7234e3ab0eb070d03e9e168
msgid "导入 2 帧已经弛豫的 Si 结构；"
msgstr "Import two relaxed Si frames;"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/perturb-card.md:46
#: 55ca38ac94704c6ea1ed40fba292f662
msgid "位移上限设为 `0.10 Å`；"
msgstr "set the displacement limit to `0.10 Å`;"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/perturb-card.md:47
#: c6be1e30e5d04a5bb8a5d553c11b141b
msgid "每个输入生成设为 `20`；"
msgstr "set outputs per input to `20`;"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/perturb-card.md:48
#: 2ea2488bf15a446baaeeb82a281805f5
msgid "使用 Sobol，并启用固定随机种子。"
msgstr "use Sobol and enable a fixed random seed."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/perturb-card.md:50
#: e1c9286b794e467495a5c40f19783268
msgid ""
"最终严格生成 $2\\times20=40$ 帧。抽查每个原子的位移向量长度应不超过 `0.10 Å`，同时检查最短 Si–Si "
"距离没有进入异常区间。"
msgstr ""
"Exactly $2\\times20=40$ frames are generated. Spot-check that each atomic"
" displacement-vector length is no greater than `0.10 Å`, and verify that "
"the minimum Si–Si distance has not entered an abnormal range."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/perturb-card.md:52
#: 9433397072f5419299b5f1c3e5bd7e93
msgid "含氢体系使用不同上限"
msgstr "Use Different Limits for a Hydrogen-Containing System"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/perturb-card.md:54
#: 6bd6dc2b73e34d54aaa5d5d49104c795
msgid ""
"开启“逐元素位移上限”，设置 `H → 0.15 Å`、`O → 0.06 "
"Å`。未列出的元素继续使用全局上限。元素符号不区分输入大小写，但无效符号和重复元素会明确报错，不会静默退回全局值。"
msgstr ""
"Enable `Per-element displacement limits` and set `H → 0.15 Å` and `O → "
"0.06 Å`. Unlisted elements continue to use the global limit. Element-"
"symbol input is case-insensitive, but invalid symbols and duplicate "
"elements produce explicit errors rather than silently falling back to the"
" global value."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/perturb-card.md:56
#: f863b7001f134476b4736f0e8efe464b
msgid "参数说明"
msgstr "Parameters"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/perturb-card.md:58
#: fb15e1d251a9497ca51ab2c44282d1eb
msgid "采样引擎（engine_type）"
msgstr "Sampling Engine (engine_type)"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/perturb-card.md:60
#: aed6f436183a4b3bb669095a30941920
msgid "`int`，默认 `1`。`0` 为 Sobol，`1` 为 Uniform。Sobol 需要 $3N$ 个维度，因此原子数上限为 7,067。"
msgstr ""
"`int`, default `1`. `0` selects Sobol and `1` selects Uniform. Sobol "
"requires $3N$ dimensions, which limits the structure to 7,067 atoms."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/perturb-card.md:62
#: 138c20c0485943bc93010ac6deb4902f
msgid "位移上限（max_distance）"
msgstr "Displacement Limit (max_distance)"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/perturb-card.md:64
#: fb85dc7668384222a6ea29abe538643f
msgid "`float`，默认 `0.25`，单位 Å。表示每个原子笛卡尔位移向量的最大长度。"
msgstr ""
"`float`, default `0.25`, in Å. This is the maximum Cartesian "
"displacement-vector length for each atom."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/perturb-card.md:66
#: 8efa7f0f5a2249afba80988a880eda65
msgid ""
"默认值面向需要覆盖较高力非平衡构型的训练集补样。若只补充近平衡构型，通常可改从 `0.05–0.15 Å` "
"开始。两个相邻原子若相向移动，相对距离最多可能改变约 $2d$，所以较大上限必须配合最短距离和力分布检查。"
msgstr ""
"The default targets training-set augmentation that needs nonequilibrium "
"configurations with relatively high forces. For near-equilibrium sampling"
" only, start around `0.05–0.15 Å`. If two neighboring atoms move toward "
"each other, their separation can change by approximately $2d$, so a large"
" limit must be paired with checks of minimum distances and the force "
"distribution."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/perturb-card.md:68
#: 788d3d20b80e43619ca8ba63830bfdb7
msgid "每个输入生成（max_num）"
msgstr "Outputs per Input (max_num)"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/perturb-card.md:70
#: 0962949943c64d3197c34e863b119a39
msgid "`int`，默认 `50`，范围 `1–10000`。每个输入结构生成的输出数；总输出数为："
msgstr ""
"`int`, default `50`, range `1–10000`. Number of outputs generated from "
"each input structure; the total output count is:"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/perturb-card.md:72
#: fa81020349284deb8dcf17c22eb2a3a6
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"\n"
"N_\\mathrm{out}=N_\\mathrm{input}\\times\\texttt{max\\_num}.\n"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/perturb-card.md:76
#: e08da8601b074685b9c1ecb922a4af24
msgid "有机分子刚体平移（identify_organic）"
msgstr "Rigid Translation of Organic Molecules (identify_organic)"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/perturb-card.md:78
#: 0006aceb8bd548eead0fd3a683c2b224
msgid "`bool`，默认 `false`。开启后，自动识别的有机连通簇整体平移，内部键长和键角保持不变。"
msgstr ""
"`bool`, default `false`. When enabled, automatically detected organic "
"connected components translate as rigid units, preserving their internal "
"bond lengths and angles."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/perturb-card.md:80
#: 2e0c392fbcf741adbdffe809520d4043
msgid "使用逐元素上限（use_element_scaling）"
msgstr "Use Per-Element Limits (use_element_scaling)"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/perturb-card.md:82
#: a2cd723867184762990501ff6b4aa61a
msgid "`bool`，默认 `false`。开启后显示逐元素位移配置；关闭时所有原子使用全局位移上限。"
msgstr ""
"`bool`, default `false`. Enabling it displays the per-element "
"displacement configuration. When disabled, all atoms use the global "
"displacement limit."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/perturb-card.md:84
#: bc9b276d7f3e4c8fa12f416292bea939
msgid "逐元素位移上限（element_scalings）"
msgstr "Per-Element Displacement Limits (element_scalings)"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/perturb-card.md:86
#: e6962450b1e64f5db13fc817e28bc57f
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"`dict[str, float] | None`，默认 `None`，单位 Å。例如 `{\"H\": 0.15, \"O\": "
"0.06}`。未列元素使用全局上限；元素符号会规范为标准大小写。无效符号、重复元素、负值或非有限值会停止运行并给出错误。"
msgstr ""
"`dict[str, float] | None`, default `None`, in Å. For example, `{\"H\": "
"0.15, \"O\": 0.06}`. Unlisted elements use the global limit, and symbols "
"are normalized to standard capitalization. Invalid symbols, duplicate "
"elements, negative values, or nonfinite values stop the operation with an"
" error."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/perturb-card.md:88
#: 9559b47049e54cd9bfe36420a833037d
msgid "使用随机种子（use_seed）"
msgstr "Use Random Seed (use_seed)"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/perturb-card.md:90
#: 26bee180506b470295d89baf2fcda330
msgid ""
"`bool`，默认 `false`。开启后，相同结构、参数和 seed "
"得到相同扰动。随机流还会结合结构内容派生，因此数据集重新排序不会改变某一帧自己的结果。"
msgstr ""
"`bool`, default `false`. When enabled, the same structure, parameters, "
"and seed produce the same perturbations. The random stream is also "
"derived from the structure content, so reordering the dataset does not "
"change a frame's own results."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/perturb-card.md:92
#: 83cb3bf490f7423ba2ee4fa7a836e5d3
msgid "随机种子（seed）"
msgstr "Random Seed (seed)"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/perturb-card.md:94
#: e8e4d1ff98194154898236553f827621
msgid "`int`，默认 `0`。仅在 `use_seed=true` 时生效。"
msgstr "`int`, default `0`. Used only when `use_seed=true`."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/perturb-card.md:96
#: ae45ef486dc34f1c8e0503b7cdbf614b
msgid "如何判断结果合理"
msgstr "How to Judge Whether the Results Are Reasonable"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/perturb-card.md:98
#: 738a77c72dcd43398ab86b261813b945
msgid "输出数量等于“输入帧数 × 每个输入生成数”；"
msgstr "the output count equals input frames × outputs per input;"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/perturb-card.md:99
#: b6db5f048e7149bb945dffd8fcfa82e6
msgid "每个原子的位移向量不超过对应上限；"
msgstr "each atom's displacement vector remains within its applicable limit;"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/perturb-card.md:100
#: 31a98775ba8549748bf9b280d758b32b
msgid "晶胞和 PBC 与输入一致；"
msgstr "the cell and PBC match the input;"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/perturb-card.md:101
#: 753fb63324f748a7aa2236aa7724c84d
msgid "开启刚体模式后，分子内部距离保持不变；"
msgstr "intramolecular distances remain unchanged when rigid mode is enabled;"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/perturb-card.md:102
#: 09a67579a7bf4e6e9f632bfe3d83cb53
msgid "最短原子间距没有进入明显非物理区间；"
msgstr ""
"the minimum interatomic distance does not enter an evidently nonphysical "
"range;"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/perturb-card.md:103
#: 42600caef46a4d8c8d0138ee3a019123
msgid "重训后应在独立 MD 或受扰动测试集上比较力误差，而不只看混合总 RMSE。"
msgstr ""
"after retraining, compare force errors on an independent MD or perturbed "
"test set rather than looking only at an aggregate mixed RMSE."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/perturb-card.md:105
#: 31480c8a506a4c98860ffec681a359b1
msgid "如果训练集已经包含足量、覆盖目标温区的 MD 轨迹，继续堆叠随机扰动可能只会产生重复样本。"
msgstr ""
"If the training set already contains sufficient MD trajectories covering "
"the target temperature range, adding more random perturbations may "
"produce only redundant samples."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/perturb-card.md:107
#: 8521a022c33b41f8bb7aed9e2af67ab4
msgid "常见问题"
msgstr "Troubleshooting"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/perturb-card.md:109
#: aa684b57d3424ee489f6020d8e9c10dd
#
msgid "**为什么扰动后出现异常短距离？** 本卡只限制每个原子的位移，不做原子对碰撞检测。降低位移上限，或在后面连接“几何健全性过滤”。"
msgstr "**Why do abnormally short distances appear after perturbation?** This card limits only each atom's displacement; it does not perform pairwise collision detection. Reduce the displacement limit or connect `Geometry Sanity Filter` downstream."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/perturb-card.md:111
#: 2f162637f67b4e48bf39e499f60c87d1
msgid "**为什么两个输入得到的总输出数翻倍？** `max_num` 是每个输入结构的输出数，而不是整批数据共享的总预算。"
msgstr ""
"**Why does using two inputs double the total output count?** `max_num` is"
" the output count for each input structure, not a total budget shared by "
"the batch."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/perturb-card.md:113
#: e1f59f66243b4cc793abe67366179b8e
msgid "**为什么逐元素设置没有运行？** 无效元素符号和重复元素现在会明确停止运行。修正红色字段提示后再执行。"
msgstr ""
"**Why did the per-element settings not run?** Invalid element symbols and"
" duplicate elements now stop the operation explicitly. Correct the field "
"marked in red before running again."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/perturb-card.md:115
#: a9d95d63758c4da69947ea9935c7e278
msgid "输出合同"
msgstr "Output Contract"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/perturb-card.md:117
#: 35fd705bb0e14b949ca2c38932eb296b
msgid "每个输入严格输出 `max_num` 个结构；空输入结构保持原行为，返回一个副本。"
msgstr ""
"Each input produces exactly `max_num` structures. An empty input "
"structure retains the existing behavior and returns one copy."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/perturb-card.md:118
#: ac56a7c2ab5942928bf0d2bb1760cbfb
msgid "`Config_type` 追加 `Pert(d=<上限>,U)` 或 `Pert(d=<上限>,S)`。"
msgstr "`Pert(d=<limit>,U)` or `Pert(d=<limit>,S)` is appended to `Config_type`."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/perturb-card.md:119
#: 1e2fbed05a1d41e78e3f7144310b9cec
msgid "`atomic_perturb` metadata 保存引擎、全局/逐元素上限、刚体模式、seed、派生 seed 和样本序号。"
msgstr ""
"The `atomic_perturb` metadata stores the engine, global and per-element "
"limits, rigid mode, seed, derived seed, and sample index."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/perturb-card.md:124
#: fa7bc051e2d94f5a807200207a5a7e34
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"{\n"
"  \"class\": \"PerturbCard\",\n"
"  \"check_state\": true,\n"
"  \"params\": {\n"
"    \"engine_type\": 0,\n"
"    \"max_distance\": 0.1,\n"
"    \"max_num\": 20,\n"
"    \"identify_organic\": false,\n"
"    \"use_element_scaling\": false,\n"
"    \"element_scalings\": {},\n"
"    \"use_seed\": true,\n"
"    \"seed\": 42\n"
"  }\n"
"}\n"
msgstr ""

#~ msgid "`max_distance` = `0.15` （单位 Å）"
